  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Enhanced capacities of constituents to design shock-responsive and sustainable social protection policies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The ILO will provide technical support to Kazakhstan to address the gaps in coverage of the population with social protection benefits and services in particular rural population, informal workers, persons with disabilities, victims of domestic violence and human trafficking. ILO will also support the constituents and relevant stakeholders to ensure that the new Social Code aligns with international social protection standards. The ILO will engage in social policy debates with the national stakeholders to reach a comprehensive social protection system.</narrative>
  </description>
